# Keep the build context small: 34 MB of results and a vendored SWE-bench
# checkout have no business being sent to the daemon.
.git
.gitignore
# Config, not image content: the api service mounts these via `env_file`, so
# baking them in would freeze one machine's settings into the image — and
# write any API key in them into a layer anyone with the image can read.
**/.env
# Bind-mounted into the api service at its fixed INSTANCES_PATH, never COPYed,
# so shipping 70+ MB to the daemon on every build buys nothing.
swebench_instances.jsonl
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.egg-info
.venv
venv
SWE-bench
results
logs
video
docs
opendraco/logs
app/dist
app/.angular
_build
*.log
